<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-047" chapter-id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin" source-id="s-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin-ws2598501">
  <p id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin:p001:m0000" ref="q63_4br_3of_A">江祏</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin:p001:m0003" ref="q63_4br_3of_A">弘業</persName>，濟陽考城人也。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin:p001:m0014" ref="069_dn8_o4r">遵</persName>，寧朔參軍。父<persName id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin:p001:m0022" ref="q63_4br_3of">德驎</persName>，司徒右長史。<persName id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin:p001:m0031" ref="q63_4br_3of_A">祏</persName>姑爲齊高帝兄始安貞王<persName id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin:p001:m0042" ref="98q_mll_d6v">道生</persName>妃，追諡<persName id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin:p001:m0048" ref="069_dn8_o4r_A">景皇后</persName>，生齊明帝。<persName id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin:p001:m0057" ref="q63_4br_3of_A">祏</persName>少爲明帝所親，恩如兄弟。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin:p002:m0000" ref="q63_4br_3of_A">祏</persName>祖<persName id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin:p002:m0002" ref="069_dn8_o4r">遵</persName>以後父贈金紫光祿大夫，父<persName id="c-nanshi-047-jiangshi-maternal-kin:p002:m0015" ref="q63_4br_3of">德驎</persName>以帝舅亦贈光祿。</p>
</text>
